# A scratch build of the Instant Battle screen's pack, for
# `play/index.html?pack=pack-dev`. The shipped pack lives on the assets
# volume; this is a checkout's local copy and belongs in neither the repo
# nor an image (`.dockerignore` names it too).
viewer/play/pack-dev

